00:58:20.540 --> 00:58:21.700
Rome, two days.

00:58:22.610 --> 00:58:23.930
Moscow, four days.

00:58:26.740 --> 00:58:29.440
The wild missile is now 400 miles from Ottawa.

00:58:36.360 --> 00:58:43.830
Sir, that was audible. Seven minutes till Paso, the city, New York City, seven minutes later.

00:58:44.780 --> 00:58:46.220
People have been sent to shelters.

00:59:07.800 --> 00:59:09.420
Many find their shelter in God.

00:59:17.770 --> 00:59:18.470
Junker's through.

00:59:19.140 --> 00:59:20.680
Yeah, well, I ain't about to try Walksville.

00:59:22.840 --> 00:59:23.760
Take whatever comes along.

00:59:31.500 --> 00:59:34.260
I've got to go as fast as I can.

00:59:34.880 --> 00:59:35.580
Sing him back.

00:59:37.500 --> 00:59:38.440
Built to take shock.

00:59:38.860 --> 00:59:41.140
Enough plutonium to blow up all of New York.

00:59:42.780 --> 00:59:44.420
About four miles from the missile base.

00:59:50.930 --> 00:59:51.810
Jeep, no less.

00:59:52.570 --> 00:59:52.970
Come on.

01:00:03.700 --> 01:00:04.760
Power out of the way!

01:00:33.370 --> 01:00:50.900
Down is

01:00:54.250 --> 01:00:55.210
Atomic warhead

01:00:56.800 --> 01:00:59.140
The lost will shortly be launched

01:01:01.350 --> 01:01:04.770
Deadly radiation. The lead shield of the box has been opened.

01:01:12.020 --> 01:01:14.720
Please give us a lift. It's urgent. I'm from Havenbrook Atomic Research.

01:01:14.840 --> 01:01:17.240
Our car was stolen. Always room for a couple more.

01:01:17.500 --> 01:01:18.520
Thank you very much.

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:31.840
Countdown is eight minutes to zero.

01:01:34.850 --> 01:01:37.070
There's the jeep. Stop the car.

01:01:38.660 --> 01:01:39.540
They've opened the box.

01:01:39.760 --> 01:01:41.920
Look, go near there. There's radioactive material.

01:01:42.080 --> 01:01:42.920
David, what are you doing?

01:01:42.940 --> 01:01:43.220
What's your idea?

01:01:44.160 --> 01:01:48.030
Loring protects his eyes, but he has condemned himself to death.

01:01:48.690 --> 01:01:50.440
Stay away! Get back!

01:02:02.840 --> 01:02:29.980
He knows what plutonium radiates.

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:33.890
means David Loring will die in minutes.

01:02:36.750 --> 01:02:40.300
Ottawa waits, a city ready to die.

01:02:40.610 --> 01:02:49.240
Nothing more can be done.

01:02:51.700 --> 01:02:55.560
Some may live only to remember for the rest of their lives

01:02:55.560 --> 01:02:58.660
the most horrible moments of destruction man has ever known.

01:03:31.310 --> 01:03:31.590
Thank you.

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:31.840
in lava-twisted girders

01:04:32.280 --> 01:04:38.340
desolation. New York has

01:04:38.340 --> 01:04:49.060
five minutes. I figured you'd

01:04:49.060 --> 01:04:51.670
stay. Gotta keep the Jews going, huh, Max?

01:04:52.180 --> 01:04:53.580
Most of the guys are staying

01:04:53.580 --> 01:04:54.700
for the finish.

01:05:01.180 --> 01:05:02.500
This is Joe Bass.

01:05:03.790 --> 01:05:05.830
Countdown is four minutes to zero.

01:05:06.860 --> 01:05:07.200
Now.

01:05:20.500 --> 01:05:21.560
Mr. Lowing is through the gate.

01:06:30.440 --> 01:06:33.330
Three minutes to zero, now.

01:07:18.490 --> 01:07:19.290
time try

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:30.040
Thank you.

01:08:00.000 --> 01:08:00.720
Thank you.

01:08:30.350 --> 01:08:48.980
29, 28, 7, 5, 4, 20, 31, 18, 12.

01:09:00.990 --> 01:09:19.980
0, 11, 8, 9, 10, 11.
